<p>Sawaal mujhse karengi ye fatima sughra <br />
Pidar kaha&rsquo;n hai bahen bhai kis jagah hai chacha</p>

<p>Agar kahongi mai mare gaye sabhi bhayya<br />
Ye sadma Fatima sughra utha na payegi<br />
Watan ko tanha na zainab hussain jayegi</p>

<p>1. Madine walo&rsquo;n ko jis waqt ye milegi qabar <br />
Safar se aagaye haaye riyaaze paighambar<br />
Kahan hai wo bhi ye puchenge qasim o akbar<br />
Ye sunke karbobala humko yaad aayegi</p>

<p>2. Kahegi kaise ke maare gaye ali akber<br />
Nishaana teere jafa ka hue ali asghar<br />
Luta hai dasht me karbobala ke mera ghar<br />
Ye gham ki maari inhei&rsquo;n kis tarah batayegi</p>

<p>3. Sitam ki qaid mei soti hai pyaari bhayya ki<br />
Karegi qabr pa zainab ye bain nana ki<br />
Hai pusht zaqmi bohat nana jaan dukhiya ki<br />
Ye sunke qabre payambar bhi thar tharayegi</p>

<p>4. Jab eid aayegi aye mere ladle bhai<br />
Tera hi soug manayegi teri majayi<br />
Naya libaas na pehnegi ye qasam khayi<br />
Kabhi na zainbe muztar khushi manayegi</p>

<p>5. Mai kis tarah se watan jao&rsquo;n sharm saar hoon mai<br />
Bohat hi zyada mere bhai beqaraar hoon mai<br />
Tum aake dekhlo khud ab bhi ashkbaar hoon mai<br />
Ke qaid me safe matam bahen bichayegi</p>
